<title>UK: P&amp;O advances on Merrill Lynch comment. [CORRECTED 11:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>P&amp;O advances on Merrill Lynch comment. [CORRECTED 11:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in construction-to-cruise liners conglomerate Peninsular and Oriental Steam Navigation Co were higher in active trade on Friday after analysts at Merrill Lynch issued an accumulate rating on the stock following a meeting with P&amp;O chairman Lord Sterling. (Corrects Merrill Lynch's rating from &quot;strong buy&quot;).</p>
<p>The shares added 22p to 625p by 0956 GMT in volume of 6.0 million shares.</p>
